title: OrrinFirst
---
Orrin: Sorrel missed three deliveries. Their last telemetry showed the drill still turning. #emotion:Worried
Taren: A working drill and nobody asking for spare parts. That is suspicious. #emotion:Curious
Orrin: Find the workers at the outpost. Then shut down whatever keeps them from answering. #emotion:Determined
<<startQuest Sorrel>>
Sela: You said "whatever". Excellent briefing. I am coming. #emotion:Amused
Taren: I was counting on it. #emotion:Happy
<<joinParty Sela>>
Orrin: Launch from any Decks airlock. Sorrel is east of the ring. Bring the drill's survey key; ours no longer matches the Gullet. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OrrinRepeat
---
Orrin: The outpost first, then the drill. If Sela stops talking, run. #emotion:Smug
===
title: OrrinPost
---
Orrin: The drill went quiet. For once, silence is good news. #emotion:Tender
Orrin: The key names the route. Sela's chart must show where it actually goes. Check them against each other. #emotion:Worried
===
title: MiraFirst
---
Mira: Two Shapers. Twice the damage to my stock, half the patience. #emotion:Amused
Mira: Six Ridge Crystals will settle a favour. Mine the bright seams on Sorrel; do not lick them. #emotion:Happy
<<startQuest MiraCrystals>>
-> Let us see the stock.
    <<shop>>
-> We will bring the crystals.
    Mira: Then I will pretend that was a promise. #emotion:Smug
===
title: MiraRepeat
---
Mira: If it sparks, I sell it. If it smokes, Hal is down the corridor. #emotion:Happy
<<shop>>
===
title: MiraPost
---
Mira: Six clear crystals. You found all the colours I asked for, including "not stolen". #emotion:Happy
<<shop>>
===
title: HalFirst
---
Hal: Hold still a moment. Your collar node is running warm. #emotion:Worried
Taren: It does that when somebody says "hold still". #emotion:Amused
Hal: Here. Scrap Alloy for your first part. The bench knows five disciplines. Make three edges and it will teach you the refined pattern. #emotion:Tender
<<giveItem ScrapAlloy 12>>
<<giveItem LatticeFilament 3>>
<<setFlag hal.lesson>>
-> Link to the fabrication bench.
    <<bench>>
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Just visiting.
    Hal: Good. Do that more often. #emotion:Happy
===
title: HalRepeat
---
Hal: You can mend a body. It is harder to mend a hurry. #emotion:Neutral
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Use the bench.
    <<bench>>
-> Leave.
    Hal: Easy on the landing. #emotion:Tender
===
title: HalPost
---
Hal: Orrin's board says the drill is quiet. Your collar node agrees. Thank you. #emotion:Happy
-> Repair and save.
    <<repair>>
-> Use the bench.
    <<bench>>
===
title: SelaWaiting
---
Sela: Orrin has the coordinates. I have several unreasonable ideas. See him first. #emotion:Playful
===
title: SelaWalkwayRepair
---
Taren: Mira. The yellow line is where the stall stops. #emotion:Neutral
Mira: It stopped. Then I needed room for the pears. #emotion:Smug
Taren: I need room to close this cover without pinching the conduit. #emotion:Determined
Sela: Does your repair include a ship? I have a receipt for one that left an hour ago. #emotion:Worried
Mira: The receipt was punctual. #emotion:Amused
Sela: I found the right dock. Eventually. Here, let me hold that side. #emotion:Playful
Taren: Keep the hinge clear. There. The cover can sit flush now. #emotion:Determined
<<stationShift>>
Mira: Did the bridge just move? #emotion:Curious
Taren: A little. I hadn't tightened that joint yet. #emotion:Worried
Sela: Both sides moved together. #emotion:Curious
Mira: Then my stall is still on its side of the line. Open the walkway before the pears bruise. #emotion:Amused
Taren: All right. Orrin has been waiting for us. #emotion:Neutral
===
title: OrrinOpening
---
Orrin: Not yet, Taren. Half my morning is stuck on the far side of that walkway. #emotion:Neutral
Orrin: Close the cover and open the gates. Then come back and I will tell you about Sorrel. #emotion:Determined
===
title: MiraOpening
---
Mira: The stall is not on your line. Your line is under my stall. Different thing. #emotion:Smug
Mira: Shut that cover and I can open. The pears keep a schedule even if your bridge does not. #emotion:Amused
===
title: SelaOpening
---
Sela: Is this bridge closed, or only resting? #emotion:Curious
Taren: Closed until I finish the cover. Give me a minute at the job. #emotion:Neutral
===
